- UBG | make the fund good from your own savings, so the poor go short of nothing | self_control: + | v: benevolence, security | tribal: give furs and meat from your own hearth, so the hungry go short of nothing | magic: make the alms good from your own purse, so the poor go short of nothing | foot: means money-.06 | chance: 90
