- U | turn the sermon into a careful series, and answer the city congregation with it | title: senior cleric | requires: ordained religious minister | without: impossible | grants_if_fails: a long shot that missed | v: achievement, self-direction | tribal: make the telling into a cycle for the long nights, and answer the far keepers with it | magic: turn the sermon into a careful cycle, and answer the great temple with it | chance: 3
