- R | say yes to the faith's call to train, and keep preaching in the street meanwhile | binds | title: ordained religious minister | requires: street preacher | without: impossible | grants_if_fails: a long shot that missed | v: stimulation, self-direction | tribal: say yes to the keepers' call, and go on speaking at every fire on the way | magic: say yes to the order's call to train, and keep preaching in the market meanwhile | chance: 3
